data: {"id": "df8541ef734b40f5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1989", "run_id": "df8541ef734b40f5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx`，命名空间 `aiops-case-07`，UID `52361280-45fe-4ec1-a8f0-292e82b90b8c`，运行在 node2/10.2.0.50 上，Pod IP 172.16.104.15。\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `python:3-alpine`，启动命令 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`，QoS Burstable。\n\n### 支持 CrashLoopBackOff 的证据（因果链完整）\n\n1. **当前状态**: Pod Status = `Running`，但容器状态 = `Waiting`，Reason = `CrashLoopBackOff`，Ready = False。\n2. **重启历史**: Restart Count = **21** 次，BackOff 事件已持续 **88分钟**，最近 8m57s 内累计 357 次 BackOff 事件。\n3. **上次崩溃详情** (", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788449299417, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

