日志记录反复出现 `level: error`, `message: CONFIG_MISSING` 发生在 `GET /work` 请求处理过程中 (证据 #4)。\n3.  **链路行为一致**：Deepflow 追踪与 Tempo Span 证实该服务在 `/work` 路径上持续返回 500 错误，且存在从网络流量到应用日志的 `trace_id` (如 `5ef67866f348c5aa93ff865f603c2cdc`) 级联关联 (证据 #5, #6)。\n\n目前已知事实足以解释 CrashLoop 的根本原因，但**具体缺失的配置项名称及正确值**这一细节仍属于未知信息，需进一步检查应用程序源码或部署配置。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 92.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx: 92.7s (Evidence 84.0s, RCA 8.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-kmfxx**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 123.4, "metrics": {"run_id": "df8541ef734b40f5", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 123.4071433544159, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 123407.1433544159, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 100916.01419448853, "tool_calls": 21, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 19, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 31304.40640449524, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 21880.162715911865}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16307.42883682251, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 92702.69751548767, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14375.137090682983, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

